  "Description__c": "Every project on one App page, for the person who runs many at once: a PMO lead, or the head of client onboarding. Each project is a row with its health worked out from its tasks: Late (with the working days behind plan), At risk (with the tasks overdue) or On track, and summary cards count them. Open a project to see its phases and tasks. Display only, so nothing moves by accident: each owner updates their own project on its record page with Project Plan (Gantt)."
